snapshot-fieldkit (0.1.0) unstable; urgency=low

  * Initial release: the SnapshOT field triage kit under
    /usr/share/snapshot/fieldkit (Windows collector for PowerShell 2.0 with a
    cmd.exe fallback, Linux collector in POSIX sh, docs, ICS extension and
    vendor lists, user-supplied/ drop folders for Sysinternals and KAPE).
  * snapshot-fieldkit-prep: partition, format (exFAT, or FAT32) and fill a USB
    stick, or refresh the kit on one while keeping its results. Refuses the
    boot medium, the root disk and non-removable disks.
  * snapshot-fieldkit-import: copy results into ~/cases/<case>/ as the
    operator, without root, through udisks; verify each collection's
    MANIFEST.sha256, write an import manifest and append to an append-only
    chain-of-custody log.

 -- Blackbird Cyber <snapshot@example.invalid>  Tue, 06 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0000
